tal feedback? We study this question in neural operator adaptation, where...", "display_url": "arxiv.org/abs/2610.12325", "end": 274, "expanded_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.12325", "images": [{"height": 1000, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113384464432951296/pmU4kxnc?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1000}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113384464432951296/pmU4kxnc?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 251, "status": 200, "title": "Prior or Feedback? What an LLM Uses When Adapting Neural Operators", "unwound_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.12325", "url": "https://t.co/iLPfyCs06m"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/xZQo29vOCY", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/AmericaGetBig/status/2113384463258558546/video/1", "media_key": "13_2113384418018725888", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/xZQo29vOCY"}]}, "id": "2113384463258558546", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Chan and Mora Jimenez, arXiv 2610.12325. LLM tunes a pretrained Fourier neural operator on a 20-trial budget. Lower held-out test nRMSE than random search and TPE in nearly every matched run. Prior vs feedback tested by intervention, not final score.\nhttps://t.co/iLPfyCs06m https://t.co/xZQo29vOCY", "url": "https://x.com/AmericaGetBig/status/2113384463258558546"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113396831354773504"]}, "author_id": "212412903", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:27:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113396833674215579"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The increasing complexity of modern telecommunications networks introduces security challenges that require systematic threat analysis. However, a gap remains between architectural threat modeling...", "display_url": "arxiv.org/abs/2610.29343", "end": 173, "expanded_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.29343", "images": [{"height": 1000, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_im